OL,3,GNEWSAPC sacked for taking snacks from
OL,4,Acrime scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has been sacked for
OL,7,Ftaking energy drinks and snacks from a
OL,8,Fcrime scene.
OL,10,FPC Andrew Cookson stole several bags of
OL,11,Fitems from a cannabis factory which had
OL,12,Fbeen discovered in a former bus depot
OL,13,Fin Gainsborough in January 2024, a
OL,14,FLincolnshire Police disciplinary panel
OL,15,Fruled.
OL,17,FThe hearing was told crime scene
OL,18,Fphotographs showed large numbers of
OL,19,Fdrinks and food in the drugs factory's
OL,20,Fliving quarters which had disappeared
OL,21,Fthe next day.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
